"<br>Exporting to HTML failed. Problems might be caused by insufficient "
"permissions in the target directory or failures in the setup of your KDE 2 "
"installation."
"<br>"
"<br>If you created your own template folder, mistakes in there may also "
"cause errors. As a last possibility, the KDE address book may be buggy, too "
":-(.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Maaf!</b>"
"<br>"
"<br>Export ke HTML gagal. masalah mungkin disebabkankekurangan izin di "
"direktori target atau gagal di aturan instalasi KDE 2 anda."
"<br>"
"<br>Jika anda membuat folder template anda sendiri, Kegagalan mungkin "
"disebabkan kesalahan. Kemungkinan terakhir, Bukualamat  KDE mungkin terdapat "
"bug, juga :-(.</qt>"

